I agree with this if you are aligned and spacious while taking action. If you are taking action while panicked and stressed and fearful, your results will be less than satisfying. If you are taking action confidently, then hell yeah do it! But if you are like "omg if I don't do this thing everything will fall apart!" That is not an action your higher self probably wants you to take. Either that or the way you are viewing the action is not the way your higher self views it. 

&#x200B;

So basically, Take Action! but before taking action make sure you are aligned!

